# GENERATED by `bun run jobs:env-allowlist:generate` — do not edit by hand.
#
# Job-scoped secrets (Issue #1120). One `<job-target> <VAR>` line per grant:
# `ops/run-job.sh <job-target>` copies <VAR> from the running app container in
# ADDITION to everything in `awcms-jobs.env-global`, and no other job does.
# The job target is the `bun run` target exactly as the crontab passes it.
#
# Deploy this file beside run-job.sh. A runner without it refuses to run: a job
# that silently lacks its secret takes the code's default and reports success.
#
# The source of truth is JOB_SCOPED in scripts/jobs-env-allowlist.ts, where each
# grant carries its reason; a test holds it to the import graph in both
# directions (no job missing a secret it reads, no job holding one it cannot).
# awcms-jobs-env-fingerprint: 32dc55bf46e20a54ac3773ce609f7a7541815723570400e20ecedffa8e304954
